==Dutch==

===Etymology===
{{bor+|nl|gml|flink||quick, gleaming}}. Perhaps ultimately related to {{der|sv|gem-pro|*flakurōną|t=to flutter, beat repeatedly}}.<ref>{{R:nl:Etymologiebank|flink}}</ref> Compare also {{cog|dum|vlinken|pos=verb}}.

===Pronunciation===
